  partName: Electrical Harness
  description: The Electrical Harness is a critical component of the jet engine,
    responsible for distributing electrical power and signals to various engine systems.
    Although its exact position, size, and shape are unknown, its importance cannot
    be overstated, as it enables the engine's control systems to function properly
    and maintain optimal performance. Interestingly, the electrical harness is designed
    to withstand the harsh environmental conditions within the engine, including
    extreme temperatures and vibrations.
